Package: usedns
Version: DEB_VERSION
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: UseDNS <usedns@x-labs.my.id>
Homepage: https://github.com/x-labs-myid/UseDNS
Depends: curl, libcurl4 | libcurl4t64, libssl3 | libssl3t64, lsof, network-manager, pkexec | policykit-1, libc6, libfontconfig1, libfreetype6, libxkbcommon0, libxcb1, libxcb-shape0, libxcb-xfixes0, libxcb-render0
Description: Desktop utility for choosing and applying DNS resolvers
 UseDNS is a lightweight desktop app for comparing public DNS
 providers and applying them from a simple interface.
 DNS changes use NetworkManager. Network Tools provide speedtest
 and local port inspection with process termination.
